Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: include <exception> for std::exception_ptr under libc++

server/src/richonline_game_registry.cpp uses std::exception_ptr but relies on
transitive includes. libc++ only forward-declares it in <__exception/operations.h>,
so the file fails to compile with LLVM-MinGW clang:

    error: variable has incomplete type 'std::exception_ptr'

Add the explicit include.

---
 server/src/richonline_game_registry.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/server/src/richonline_game_registry.cpp b/server/src/richonline_game_registry.cpp
--- a/server/src/richonline_game_registry.cpp
+++ b/server/src/richonline_game_registry.cpp
@@ -1,8 +1,9 @@
 #include "richonline_game_registry.hpp"
 
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <atomic>
+#include <exception>
 #include <set>
 #include <utility>
 
 namespace richnet {
